<title>DUBAI: Aramco raises bunker diesel prices, A-960 unchanged.</title>
<headline>Aramco raises bunker diesel prices, A-960 unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has increased A-888 bunker diesel prices from Ras Tanura and Dammam ports by $3 a tonne to $238 with effect December 19, the company said.</p>
<p>A-888 from Jeddah and Yanbu is $1 up at $236 a tonne.</p>
<p>A-960 bunker fuel oil prices are unchanged at $125 a tonne ($19.19 a barrel from all four ports).</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255.</p>
</text>
